name: production-graph
displayName: Production Graph
author: VadymChan
description: "Factorio-style production statistics for Mindustry: per-item, per-fluid and power production & consumption over time, with time windows and a filterable list. Tabs: Items (global machine output or net core change), Electricity (team power network), Fluids. Press F8 in a loaded map to open the panel."
version: "0.2"
minGameVersion: 159
